# Deeproot Pilgrimage {1}{U}: "Whenever one or more nontoken Merfolk you control become tapped, create a 1/1 blue Merfolk creature
# token with hexproof" (CR 603.2c, 111.7). Two Merfolk of the Pearl Trident and a Memnite (not a Merfolk) attack together on turn 3:
# the two Merfolk tap at once, so ONE token is made (not two), and the tapping Memnite adds nothing. The token is a 1/1 blue Merfolk
# with hexproof. On turn 5 the token (a Merfolk, but a token) and the Memnite attack together: nothing happens, the token is not a
# nontoken Merfolk, so there is still exactly one token.

